1,Quiavicuzas Zapotec - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quiavicuzas_Zapotec,"December 15, 2024 - Quiavicuzas Zapotec (Northeastern Yautepec Zapotec, Zapoteco de San Juan Lachixila) is a Zapotecan language of the isthmus of Mexico.","Zapotec, Quiavicuzas",Otomanguean
